# --- models: IN the repository since 2026-09-11 (Majd). The two GraspGen
# checkpoints (450 MB + 38 MB) travel through Git LFS (GraspGen/.gitattributes);
# YOLO weights, the MediaPipe hand model and the Vosk model are plain files.
# From the GraspGen checkout only what runs is kept: no other grippers'
# checkpoints, no compiled build output, no figures/sample data/editor cache.
GraspGen/models/*
!GraspGen/models/README.md
!GraspGen/models/graspgen_robotiq_2f_140.yml
!GraspGen/models/graspgen_robotiq_2f_140_dis.pth
!GraspGen/models/graspgen_robotiq_2f_140_gen.pth
# Franka Panda config is tracked; its checkpoints (866 MB + 159 MB) would
# exceed the free Git LFS quota — download them from Hugging Face (see
# GraspGen/models/README.md).
!GraspGen/models/graspgen_franka_panda.yml
GraspGen/pointnet2_ops/build/
GraspGen/**/*.egg-info/
GraspGen/fig/
GraspGen/sample_data/
GraspGen/.vscode/
*.onnx
*.engine

